      "start_seconds": 228.87,
      "end_seconds": 243.34,
      "duration_seconds": 14.47,
      "text": "it's pantoprazole, 40 milligrams, before breakfast so, though honestly, some days I forget to take it i take my steroid tablets, 5 milligrams, stopped last week"
