      "start_seconds": 245.18,
      "end_seconds": 259.64,
      "duration_seconds": 14.46,
      "text": "so where does that leave us? It's hard to say a possible adrenal crisis after stopping steroids is one possibility and a severe infection another, and I'd rather not commit yet"
